Package: asaData
Type: Package
Title: Datasets from Hosmer and Colleagues' 'Applied Survival Analysis'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(c("Graeme", "L."), "Hickey", email = "graemeleehickey@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An unofficial companion package to the first and second editions
    of 'Applied Survival Analysis: Regression Modeling of Time to Event Data'
    by Hosmer and Lemeshow (1999, ISBN:9780471154105), and Hosmer, Lemeshow,
    and May (2008) <doi:10.1002/9780470258019>. Includes 16 datasets covering
    all 18 source files, with shared datasets represented once, original numeric
    coding, parsed dates, and documentation of variables and edition differences.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
URL: https://github.com/graemeleehickey/asaData
BugReports: https://github.com/graemeleehickey/asaData/issues
Roxygen: list(markdown = FALSE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
